{"t":"Small Cask","s":"small-cask-b0ee7","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Small_Cask_db15cc.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Small Cask</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Small Cask\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Small_Cask_db15cc.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Other Objects<br/>Quest Objects<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Casks\">Casks</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.6<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 12, 2005<br/>Christmas Update 2005</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20070319014306&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Beer_Cask_eeeea2.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a small cask.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It is filled with the blood of the snake god.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>You can find 7 of these in the underground temple of lizards under the Ape City, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32864,32503,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32864, 32503, 9)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It contains strange red fluid that was left by lizard ancestors.<br/>\nIt looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Beer%20Cask\">Beer Cask</a>, a Lemonade Cask, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Cask%20of%20Brown%20Ale\">Cask of Brown Ale</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Cask%20of%20Brown%20Ale%20%28Item%29\">Cask of Brown Ale (Item)</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Rum%20Cask\">Rum Cask</a>, a Water Cask and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Wine%20Cask\">Wine Cask</a>.\nPart of The Ape City Quest - Mission 7: Destroying Casks.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Beer%20Cask\">Beer Cask</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cask%20of%20Brown%20Ale\">Cask of Brown Ale</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cask%20of%20Brown%20Ale%20%28Item%29\">Cask of Brown Ale (Item)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Casks\">Casks</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Containers\">Containers</a></li><li>Lemonade Cask</li><li>Other Objects</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rum%20Cask\">Rum Cask</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-ape-city-quest\">The Ape City Quest</a></li><li>Water Cask</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wine%20Cask\">Wine Cask</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-ape-city-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-ape-city-quest","quest":"The Ape City Quest","step":"7-0","n":33,"title":"Pedir a missão","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32826,"y":32574,"z":6,"label":"Hairycles"}]}],"spots":[{"x":32864,"y":32503,"z":9,"text":"You can find 7 of these in the underground temple of lizards under the Ape City, here ."}]}}